{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkkvHae22r5N7ryySn8C","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NTw4bSeL424giYSed2QJeH","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium.build-v2__20261105-171824__x10629c/work/CreditorCreek*/; python3 - <<'E'\np='src/systems/year.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"new THREE.MeshBasicNodeModelFallback ? undefined : new THREE.MeshBasicNodeMaterial({ color: PALETTE.white })\",\"new THREE.MeshBasicNodeMaterial({ color: PALETTE.white })\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/systems/hud.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"    if (g.banner) {\",\"    if (g.fireworkPattern) { const fp = g.fireworkPattern; fp.t -= 1 / 60; const names = ['ink','plum','red','orange','sand','lime','green','teal','navy','blue','sky','cyan','white','mist','slate','night']; const sz = 5; const x0 = W / 2 - 40, y0 = 30; for (let y = 0; y < 16; y++) for (let x = 0; x < 16; x++) { const c = fp.pat.px[y * 16 + x]; if (c !== 12 && c !== 15) d.rect(x0 + x * 5, y0 + y * 5, 5, 5, names[c]); } }\\n    if (g.busText?.text) { d.rect(40, H - 60, W - 80, 24, 'night'); d.text(W / 2, H - 52, g.busText.text, 'sand', { align: 'center' }); }\\n    if (g.banner) {\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nE\ncd ..; python3 - <<'E'\ns=open('PROGRESS.md').read()\ni=s.index('## Status log')\ns=s[:i]+'''## Status log (update!)\nBOOTS and renders (title, village, player, City night neon, store interior look right). Build: `cd G && node tools/build.mjs`. Screenshot: `node tests/shot.mjs ../<html> shots/x.png \"js with __GAME__.game/.sys\" steps`. Headless: tests/play/lib.mjs (boot,newGame,hold,press,walkTo,T), tests/play/smoke.mjs passes.\nGotchas: ctx.random.fork() is an object -> g.rng()/g.cosmetic(). Setup order registerSystems -> city.build -> places.build -> nature.init. sys merged: index.js systems + extras(g) (homeRoom, chimeEdit, bed, favours, placement) + more.js moreSystems (c