IHub.connect before Engine.start, meta tags exist in build), Visit (BroadcastChannel) or remove 'Visit' title entry, attract mode (systems/attract.js: start/update/drive/exit on any input; title idle 10s already calls g.startAttract), dev mode checks, snowman verb, pattern opener, tests/run.mjs aggregate (sim/play/browser/hub), data/about.js feedback text, exit-interview.json, final build + root HTML, playthrough test, polish (interior sky dark, occluders, weather forced via g.forceWeather unused).\n'''\nopen('PROGRESS.md','w').write(s)\nE\necho ok"}}}
