{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgknwvg5K2RjnS4o97fwy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I did more of PLAN.md after the hook feedback, but not all of it. The full test run now passes: 416 checks, 0 failures.\n\n**Added this round:**\n- **Dust bunnies:** after real days away, up to 8 pile up at home. You can stomp them.\n- **Neighbour chat bubbles:** neighbours that stand near each other trade short bubbles you can read up close.\n- **Catalogue:** at the Hall you can reorder anything you've owned, and it arrives by mail next day.\n- **Shirt patterns:** a pattern from the studio can be worn on your shirt.\n- **Bigger homes:** tier 3 adds an annex and tier 4 adds an upstairs room.\n- **Visit:** open your gate in one window and a guest joins from another over BroadcastChannel. A guest can't use the bus or fell trees, keeps their pockets and beans when leaving, and your own save is untouched. It's only for two windows on one computer. The two-computer WebRTC invite codes are not built. The title only offers Visit in a browser with BroadcastChannel and outside an AI Hub session.\n- **Sheets check:** `src/art/models.js` has three of my own prop models, and the kit's `check.mjs --sheets` passes on them. It is now one of the suites run by `node tests/run.mjs`.\n- **Village size:** widened to 80 tiles across.\n\n**Still not done:**\n- **Village depth:** the village is 80×46, not the plan's 80×64.\n- **Umbrellas:** patterns on umbrellas are not done.\n- **Lost & Found:** it is only flavour text, with no real logic.\n- **Home tiers:** the annex and upstairs are mostly empty rooms with a joke, not furnishable.\n- **Art:** it is built from primitives in code, not the engine's model format, apart from those three props.\n\n`exit-interview.json` and the built HTML are in the work folder and are regenerated from the current build. The About screen and the Online and Testing fields now mention Visit and the extra tests, but the Testing, Engine and Prompt Feedback answers are unchanged from my earlier reply."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":204,"cache_read_input_tokens":591355,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":204},"output_tokens":703,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"c35e8ff0-fff0-4a9b-b2a1-3aae147b41aa","timestamp":"2026-11-06T01:18:05.060Z","request_id":"req_011CgknwvMEFbX5m1fgnwekZ"}
