{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgko9pfWqxe97U6sb8E6e","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I finished the four items from the last hook feedback. The full test run now passes: 422 checks, 0 failures. That includes the build, the simulation checks, the scripted playthrough, the browser checks, the AI Hub harness, the two-page Visit test and the kit's sheets check.\n\n- **Village size:** the village is now 80×64. The new south part is a palm island, reached by extending the dock, with its own beach and trees. A new simulation check confirms the island is reachable.\n- **Umbrellas:** a held umbrella now shows above your head. The pattern umbrella carries a pattern you drew in the studio.\n- **Lost & Found:** the Hall's bin now works. The bee turns up a few lost items each day, and you can take them or leave something of your own.\n- **Annex and upstairs:** both rooms can now be furnished with the same placement mode as the main room. Each remembers its own furniture.\n\nI did not edit the Testing, Engine and Prompt Feedback answers. The Hall's Lost & Found works, but I didn't check its interface visually.\n\n`exit-interview.json` and the built HTML in the work folder are up to date."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":288,"cache_read_input_tokens":600653,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":288},"output_tokens":370,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"81e159dc-6480-4d35-8aa0-d6653829b71e","timestamp":"2026-11-06T01:20:44.439Z","request_id":"req_011Cgko9pQdMm5EAigoJJaAr"}
