{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkot7H4BwqoFrxBkbtck","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I filled in more of the section 16 art, and the full test run on the final build passes with 426 checks, 0 failures.\n\n**Added:**\n- **Fish:** there is now a fish model per species, sized and coloured by its data, including a boot, a puffer, an eel and a flounder. You hold it up over your head when you first catch one. The museum aquarium shows them in tanks.\n- **Bugs:** there are individual bug models in the world and in the museum: butterflies, dragonfly, bumblebee, stag and rhino beetles, snail, ladybird, woolly bear, cricket/grasshopper/mantis and firefly.\n- **Tools in hand:** the net, rod, shovel, axe, watering can and slingshot each appear in your hand when equipped.\n- **Fossils:** the Moatosaur and Regretodon skeletons assemble in the Fossil Hall from the parts you donate. The single fossils (trilobite and the others) show up as small stand-in pieces.\n- **Paintings:** eight pixel-art paintings, one per parody title, hang in the gallery. They pass the engine's texture validator.\n- **House and store exteriors:** the house exterior changes with your debt tier, with a porch, then an annex wing, then a second storey with a plaque. The store grows an awning, sign and extra floor at the two spending thresholds.\n\nI looked at screenshots of the museum and the tier-4 house, and the museum items look sparse and small. I did not look at the store tiers, the in-hand tools or the held-up catch.\n\n**Still open from section 16:**\n- **Forgery paintings:** the plan asks for a forgery variant of each painting; Magda's forgeries are described in text and a small red mark function exists, but Magda's shop doesn't display painting models.\n- **Tree variety:** there are growth stages and fruit, but no separate palm, pine and pear designs beyond what I had.\n- **Characters and buildings as model definitions:** the characters and most buildings are still built from code primitives, not the engine's model format. The kit's sheets check covers only the five prop models.\n- **Real two-computer Visit:** I tested the invite codes only between two browser sessions on this machine.\n\n`exit-interview.json`, the About screen and the built HTML in the work folder carry the updated art description."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":564,"cache_read_input_tokens":633385,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":564},"output_tokens":693,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"e08db8e5-2bdc-46c2-bd26-c4fbeda98419","timestamp":"2026-11-06T01:30:20.937Z","request_id":"req_011Cgkot6zCoDuGTTuM2N7iZ"}
