{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkp9p1gwmXZLhjwY9K7H","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I closed two of the items you listed: forgery paintings now show in Magda's shop, and every building body now uses the engine's model format. The full test run on the final build passes with 426 checks, 0 failures.\n\n- **Forgery paintings:** during Magda's inspection the shop now hangs the actual painting on the wall, 1.6 times normal size. A forgery gets a red mark in the corner and a slightly crooked frame, alongside the text description of what's off. I did not look at a screenshot of this.\n- **Buildings in the model format:** one parametric house definition now builds the walls, roof, door, mat, window sills and chimney for every cottage, the store, hall, museum, Mothwick's and the bus shelter. The glowing night windows are still added as separate meshes on top. The kit's sheets check passes on it with 0 problems.\n- **Tools in hand and held-up catch:** I looked at screenshots. The rod and net show in your hand when equipped. The pike catch appears partly above the head in the held-up pose, though a tree dissolve effect covers part of it in that frame.\n- **Tree variety:** I didn't change anything here, because oak, pear, pine and palm already each have their own build. If that variety is what the plan wants, it's done; if it wants them as model-format definitions, they aren't.\n\n**Still open from section 16:** the characters and trees are still built in code, not as model-format definitions. Characters need named joints for animation, and trees recolour their canopies by season, which the merged model format doesn't support. I didn't convert them for that reason.\n\n`exit-interview.json`, the About screen and the built HTML in the work folder are current. The feedback answers now say six ModelDefs."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1050,"cache_read_input_tokens":644413,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1050},"output_tokens":549,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"08baf08f-2414-4666-b553-e866ec35796e","timestamp":"2026-11-06T01:33:52.780Z","request_id":"req_011Cgkp9ohaRDj2xFnMyuDr1"}
