{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkpUPhVHx4CCcoK8ZNrc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Characters and trees are now built in the engine's model format, and the full test run on that build passes with 426 checks, 0 failures. Afterwards I only changed the About text and the exit-interview answers, then rebuilt the HTML and re-ran the simulation checks, which also pass.\n\n- **Characters:** all 27 species, the player and Magda's crowd are now generated as model definitions, with named pivot joints for the seven animation joints plus eyes, mouth and shirt. The same 44 clips still compile and play on them. I checked that every species builds, has its joints, and that two characters of the same kind get separate objects. These runtime critter definitions are not drawn as sheets.\n- **Trees:** oak, pear, pine and palm are each a model definition with a growth stage and a fruit count (up to three pears). They rebuild when the season, growth stage or fruit changes, so autumn recolours still work. I looked at an autumn screenshot and the trees come out orange and red.\n- **Sheets check:** ten model definitions pass with 0 problems and 0 warnings: the bell, notice board, bench, stall, cheese wheel, village house and the four trees.\n- **Feedback text:** the Testing answers now describe the ten sheeted models and the generated critters.\n- **Forgery paintings:** I did not look at a screenshot of Magda's shop hanging a painting.\n\n**Still open from section 16:** the plan wants characters with distinct silhouettes at 45 px, and I didn't re-check that in screenshots after the change. Some of its extras are also simplified, like Dr. Quill rolling into a ball and the full hat and glasses lists.\n\n`exit-interview.json`, the About screen and the built HTML in the work folder are current."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":612,"cache_read_input_tokens":667217,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":612},"output_tokens":565,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"19771195-9ff5-4614-b7b5-ea01d2cc7bc2","timestamp":"2026-11-06T01:38:05.240Z","request_id":"req_011CgkpUPP8XqGHQUkBcDgJY"}
