{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkpnDhDStrjquGmcJvr9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The final full run finished: 426 checks, 0 failures. That's on the build that includes this round's changes (Quill rolling, room-host animation, the larger clothes lists, Magda's painting camera).\n\nTwo limits on what this shows:\n- The tests don't exercise the new clothes lists beyond the existing play checks, so the 24 outfits, 12 hats, 6 glasses and 6 umbrellas are counted from the data, not tested in play.\n- `exit-interview.json` was regenerated after the code changes but before this run, and the feedback text still doesn't mention the larger clothes lists. It stays accurate, since it doesn't give clothes counts.\n\nEverything the task asks you to hand in is in the work folder: the built HTML, `exit-interview.json`, the dev folder and `PROGRESS.md`. The Source Information, Testing, Engine and Prompt Feedback text is in the About screen and in `exit-interview.json`, and the same text is in my earlier replies in this session.\n\nStill open from PLAN.md:\n- 13 of the 27 species were not checked for distinct silhouettes.\n- Wombat and quokka look alike.\n- The red forgery mark on Magda's paintings was not checked.\n- The two-computer Visit was only tested between two browser sessions on this machine."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1026,"cache_read_input_tokens":686120,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1026},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"6de51785-b2df-414d-a04a-47994470c1db","timestamp":"2026-11-06T01:42:06.437Z","request_id":"req_011CgkpnDMt1G7