{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says. Done when: Everything in PLAN.md that can be done on this computer is done, and everything TASK.md asks you to hand in is in this folder.]: Not satisfied. The assistant's own last message lists open PLAN.md items it could still do on this machine: flamingo and badger look alike in the screenshot and were not fixed, the AI Hub harness, Visit and sheets suites were not re-run after the critter-shape change, and the About and feedback text was not updated to match the final state. Also, in the transcript, the species silhouette check was rough (some species partly hidden behind the market stall) and no full-suite run was done after the last art change. The deliverables (built HTML, exit-interview.json, PROGRESS.md) do exist in the work folder, but PLAN.md completeness is not shown."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"2b5d5085-5561-4aa0-aa8d-2bd99f9806e0","timestamp":"2026-11-06T01:44:06.169Z","isSynthetic":true}
