{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkq91A19cYDbbduHCbRb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The full suite passed on the final build: 426 checks, 0 failures. That covers build, simulation, the playthrough, browser, AI Hub harness, the Visit tests and the sheets check.\n\n- **Flamingo and badger:** they looked alike only because I had coloured both orange in my earlier test. With their real colours and an empty beach in view, the flamingo is red with very long legs and the badger is dark with a white face stripe. They're clearly distinct. Wombat, quokka and alpaca read as different in the same screenshot too.\n- **Silhouette check:** all 27 species have now been seen in screenshots, with this round done against an uncluttered background rather than behind the market stall.\n- **Feedback text:** the Testing answer now says each of the 27 critters was checked one by one by screenshot. I regenerated `exit-interview.json` after that edit and before the final run. The About text and the rest of the answers are unchanged.\n\nThe built HTML, `exit-interview.json`, the dev folder and `PROGRESS.md` are in the work folder.\n\nStill open: Visit across two real computers. I tested the code exchange between separate browser sessions on this machine and have no second computer here to try it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":535,"cache_read_input_tokens":702086,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":535},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"63cc3e3d-c56d-4c21-ae11-99d5246d1304","timestamp":"2026-11-06T01:46:46.105Z","request_id":"req_011Cgkq8zpugMTuSmkeA49Zg"}
