{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkqdLytgV3iCwcikA5Uk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The full suite, with the new Visit checks included, passes on the final build: 428 checks, 0 failures. That covers the build, simulation checks, the scripted playthrough, the browser suite, the AI Hub harness (four scenarios), Visit and the sheets check.\n\nEverything TASK.md asks you to hand in is in the work folder:\n- **Game:** `CreditorCreek-AnimalCrossingCityFolk-claude-sonnet-5-5-medium-20261105-171824.html`, built from the dev folder of the same name and opening from `file://`.\n- **Exit interview:** `exit-interview.json`, in TASK.md's shape and identical to the feedback text in the About screen.\n- **Progress file:** `PROGRESS.md`, with the build, test and cut notes.\n\nThe Source Information, Testing, Engine and Prompt Feedback text is in the About screen and `exit-interview.json`, and in my earlier replies in this session.\n\nOne thing is still not done: Visit on two real computers. There is no second machine here, so I couldn't try a real network connection. I tested the code exchange between two pages in one browser, between separate sessions, and between two separate browser processes.\n\nThe plan has other gaps I haven't listed since the last round, such as a few extras in the art and venue lists that I simplified. `PROGRESS.md` has the list I kept."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":533,"cache_read_input_tokens":720150,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":533},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"0b27435b-34e1-4b22-9c05-f07d774d8f29","timestamp"