{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkqot7fZhLNaqgiAMPax","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The full suite is running on the build with the new features. I'll report the result when it finishes.\n\nI did a real pass through PLAN.md this round and found features I had skipped, rather than just listing gaps. I built these:\n\n- **Favours:** two a day, with a \"!\" marker over the neighbour's head. There are 12 templates in five kinds (fetch, catch within an hour, deliver, return, trade). They pay beans and friendship. The play suite checks that one is accepted and paid out. In a screenshot, Lady Ottoline shows the \"!\".\n- **Ambience:** eight sound loops (river, surf, rain, wind, crickets, birds, city hum, neon buzz) fade with distance and weather, plus falling petals in spring, leaves in autumn and fireflies on summer nights.\n- **Worn paths:** grass you walk over often turns to path and slowly heals.\n- **Gold Bell:** the Old Bell turns gold when the town rating is high.\n- **Smaller touches:** tree canopies sway in the wind, your eyes puff up after a wasp sting and neighbours comment, and Rocco now asks whether you want him to stay on day 7, which changes his goodbye letter.\n\nThe play suite is now 99 checks, 0 failures; the rest of the suites are still running.\n\nI did not check the gold Bell colour, the puffy eyes or the ambience sound by eye or ear. The tests only confirm the settings are applied.\n\nI still haven't done the Visit test on two real computers: there is no second machine here."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":436,"cache_read_input_tokens":735795,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":436},"output_tokens":496,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_mana