{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkr92EbezWM129dvJgkM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The full suite is running on the latest build, and I'll report when it finishes.\n\nI made a second pass through PLAN.md this round and built more of what I had skipped:\n\n- **Weather and scenery:** ground fog that thickens in fog weather and autumn mornings, a rainbow after rain clears in the daytime, smoke from chimneys, an animated waterfall at the river's head, and a clothesline by your plot.\n- **Beachcombing:** six shells or driftwood oddities appear on the sand each day.\n- **Target marker:** a bouncing chevron now appears over whatever you're about to interact with, alongside the prompt text.\n- **Live TV:** the TV in your home now shows a live camera feed of the plaza. The town stays loaded while you're inside so the feed has something to show. In a screenshot the screen shows the green plaza, though the picture is small. The mirror is a real reflecting mirror, but the same screenshot only shows its frame, so I didn't confirm a reflection.\n\nI haven't checked the fog, rainbow, smoke, waterfall or clothesline by eye, and still haven't checked the gold Bell, puffy eyes or ambience by eye or ear. I don't know yet whether the suite passes with these changes. I also still can't test Visit on two real computers."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":435,"cache_read_input_tokens":753444,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":435},"output_tokens":420,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"aea8e6b9-73ef-4084-aced-4583b4ee69f9","timestamp":"2026-11-06T01:59:55.071Z","request_id":"req