{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkruyJFE6962vuABr1C7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The full suite is running on the build with this round's changes. I'll report once it finishes.\n\nThis round I built several of the remaining items and checked two of them by eye:\n\n- **Lookout hill:** the village now has a raised hill, 2 metres high with cliff faces and a ramp on its south side. In a test the player walks up the ramp and the avatar rises to the top (floor height 2). In a screenshot the player stands on top next to the bench. The plan's whole upper terrace row with the Museum on it is not built. I made just this one raised area.\n- **Spring tails:** characters with tails (lemur, platypus, quokka, possum, ferret, stoat, magpie, goose, dormouse) now have a tail joint that swings with turning and idles with a gentle sway. It uses a damped spring I wrote, not the engine's SpringChain class. I haven't looked at it in motion.\n- **Live critters at home:** the fish tank shows up to three fish you've caught swimming, and the bug cage shows bugs fluttering. I haven't seen this on screen.\n- **Mirror:** in a screenshot the mirror glass shows a reflection of the room (the bed and window). This is verified.\n\nI could not confirm the gold Bell by eye. The Old Pear's canopy covers it in every screenshot angle I tried; it is a simple colour swap. I haven't checked puddles, cloud shadows or the ambience sound by eye or ear.\n\nI still can't test Visit on two real computers: there is no second machine here. `AUDIT.md` records the remaining gaps: the full upper terrace, and parts of the plan's longer festival set pieces."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":435,"cache_read_input_tokens":799169,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":435},"output_tokens":532,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"5caf0428-c4e5-4220-ae86-35e615c72b85","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:10:03.978Z","request_id":"req_011CgkruxnzG8Aczz5EhC8FN"}
