{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgks7e4SRn7fjzvaRGXzw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The full suite is running with the new checks. I'll report once it finishes.\n\nInstead of leaving the unchecked items unchecked, I added play-test checks for the things a script can verify, and the first run of them passes:\n\n- **Gold Bell:** the Bell's colour changes to gold when the flag is set.\n- **Tails:** the lemur's tail joint swings when its owner moves.\n- **Live tank:** with two caught fish and a tank, the tank shows exactly two swimming fish.\n- **Weather props:** puddles appear in rain and cloud shadows appear on a sunny day.\n- **Ambience:** the river loop is much louder at the bank than far away, and surf is audible on the beach.\n\nThat brought the play suite to 108 checks, 0 failures. These are script checks of the settings, not listening or looking, so I still haven't heard or watched any of them.\n\n`AUDIT.md` now has a section listing what was checked by script, what by screenshot, and what is still not built. That list is the plan's whole upper terrace row with the Museum on it (only the Lookout hill is raised), the longer festival set pieces, and a real two-computer Visit test."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":436,"cache_read_input_tokens":803691,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":436},"output_tokens":375,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"084ae93d-2cde-420f-ae1c-9c4fe30df3d7","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:12:41.185Z","request_id":"req_011Cgks7df8vSaRzvUxK7PwD"}
