{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgksQ4146STR4rb36MTYa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The suite and three repeat runs of the AI Hub harness are running. I'll report when they finish.\n\nThe previous full run had one failure: the \"host leaves\" hub scenario. Re-running that scenario alone five times passed every time, so it is a timing flake: the four game copies render in software and the game was slow to get ready.\n\nInstead of just re-running, I made the hub round start faster. When the game opens inside an AI Hub session it now skips building the village, the City, the interiors and the furniture pack, which a round never uses, so it reaches the point where it tells the hub it is ready sooner.\n\nThe total run before the failure was 444 checks, 1 failure; I'll report the new totals once the run and the repeats are done."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":485,"cache_read_input_tokens":808616,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":485},"output_tokens":228,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"f1fcdf99-52c9-4465-8a6e-6c7c036092d3","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:16:23.140Z","request_id":"req_011CgksQ3azsv79ryvKicXMA"}
