{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkshSMBVgNnVAihPmTfA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The full suite now passes: 444 checks, 0 failures. I then ran the AI Hub harness's four scenarios three more times and all three runs passed.\n\nThe leaner hub startup fixed the flaky \"host leaves\" scenario, or at least made it much less likely. I can't prove it is gone from four clean runs, since it failed only about one run in six before.\n\nI also regenerated `exit-interview.json` earlier this round, and the built HTML, the dev folder (with `AUDIT.md`), `exit-interview.json` and `PROGRESS.md` are in the work folder.\n\nStill open, as `AUDIT.md` records:\n- **Plan's whole upper terrace:** the Museum is not on a raised terrace; only the Lookout hill is raised.\n- **Festivals:** they are shorter than the plan's longer set pieces.\n- **Visit on two real computers:** there is no second machine here. I've only tested the code exchange between browser sessions and processes on this one.\n- **Not checked by eye or ear:** the tail motion, live tank critters, puddles, cloud shadows and ambience sound. Script checks cover them, but I haven't seen or heard them."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":793,"cache_read_input_tokens":809101,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":793},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"f15a3b2a-3d52-42a9-83d3-bb649a82b7a6","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:20:19.456Z","request_id":"req_011CgkshRu9uAXA6qCh2rHRq"}
