{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgksnacQz8tAy9KaPHwXw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The full suite is running on the build with the terrace change. I'll report the result when it finishes.\n\nI built the plan's upper terrace this round. The Museum now stands on a raised terrace 2 metres up, with cliff faces and a ramp running south from its door. In a screenshot the player stands on the ramp's path in front of the Museum, which shows as a dissolved white building.\n\nThe village is now flagged in the audit as having two raised areas, the Lookout hill and the Museum terrace. The simulation check that every door can be reached passes with the terrace in place.\n\nThat screenshot also showed the cloud shadow as a solid dark ellipse, which looked wrong. I made it a faint translucent shadow instead and haven't looked at the result.\n\nI still can't test Visit on two real computers: there is no second machine here. The festival set pieces are also still shorter than the plan describes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":474,"cache_read_input_tokens":818397,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":474},"output_tokens":279,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"fe3773c4-6461-4114-97f5-599c08af8a64","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:21:28.849Z","request_id":"req_011CgksnaCNL1HiZvFEqmaQU"}
