{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkt27HFdX8k5CjaQE46U","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The full suite is running on the build with the festival additions. I'll report when it finishes.\n\nI extended the festivals instead of leaving them as they were:\n\n- **Bunting:** every festival day now has coloured flags strung around the plaza.\n- **Long Night:** the sun now sets at 16:00 on that day, every door gets a string of coloured lights, and Rocco rolls into the plaza on the Roll animation before he speaks, as the plan describes.\n- **Lantern Float:** 160 lanterns now float down the river instead of 60.\n\nIn a screenshot of the Long Night, the lamps are lit, the snow is falling and the light strings show on the houses. The bunting is there too but looks very dark at night, so it barely reads. I haven't watched Rocco's roll-in, the lantern float or the other festival days in motion.\n\nThe festivals are still compact set pieces of a few minutes each, not whole-village simulations where every neighbour acts out the festival. I've listed that as a remaining gap in `AUDIT.md`. Visit on two real computers is still untested: there is no second machine here."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":445,"cache_read_input_tokens":828297,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":445},"output_tokens":354,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"8b49ab25-b858-4552-9a7a-5cc7d7cbce68","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:24:34.434Z","request_id":"req_011Cgkt26tS5GhHT1mGBLQCH"}
