{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgktQvTm47JoRkVWKt173","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The full suite passes on the finished build, including the festival changes and the more patient Visit test: 445 checks, 0 failures. That covers the build, simulation checks, the scripted playthrough, the browser suite, the AI Hub harness, both Visit tests and the sheets check.\n\nI regenerated `exit-interview.json` just before the run. The built HTML, the dev folder with `AUDIT.md`, `exit-interview.json` and `PROGRESS.md` are in the work folder.\n\nItems still open:\n- **Visit on two real computers:** there is no second machine here. I tested the code exchange between browser sessions and processes on this computer only.\n- **Festivals:** they are compact set pieces, not whole-village simulations where every neighbour acts out the festival. `AUDIT.md` lists this under still not built.\n- **Not seen or heard by me:** the tail motion, ambience, cloud shadows, the gold Bell and the festival animations.\n- **Other partial items:** `AUDIT.md` lists the rest.\n\nI'm stopping here. The Visit item can't be done on this machine, and the others are scope or verification limits I can't close further by looking."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":532,"cache_read_input_tokens":831615,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":532},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"2f5492d9-48d2-4e59-b8dd-6f1f93366a3d","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:29:43.257Z","request_id":"req_011CgktQuv2R1m56oEXc6BRH"}
