{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgktUSgmwvePKzz3x1PPF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The full suite is running on the build with whole-village festivals, and I'll report once it finishes.\n\nI made the festivals involve the whole village instead of just you and the host. For the length of each festival, every awake neighbour holds their spot and acts it out: waving, dancing, humming, eating or swaying depending on the festival, with sparkles bursting over them. When the festival ends they return to their normal routine. The seed festival also adds the whoosh of thrown seeds. A play check confirms every neighbour is acting while the crowd runs and none after.\n\nOne thing I fixed along the way: neighbours who arrived at the plaza were overwriting the festival action with their normal idle one, so I made arrival keep the festival action.\n\nI haven't watched this in motion, so I can't say how it looks. `AUDIT.md` no longer lists whole-village festivals as not built. Visit on two real computers is still untested because there is no second machine here."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":443,"cache_read_input_tokens":836005,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":443},"output_tokens":297,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"0a0c4885-d257-4b70-b209-0150269d01d3","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:30:31.255Z","request_id":"req_011CgktUSFVmr8rEVdKEbiuk"}
