{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkthfMu15Qvjfjayxyby","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The full suite is running on the latest build, and I'll report when it finishes.\n\nI went through the plan's smaller promises one by one and fixed the ones the code didn't keep:\n\n- **Coffee:** the Daily Grind's jog-speed buff now ends at noon, as the plan says, not at the end of the day. A play check covers it.\n- **Fortune luck:** Madame Nibbles's luck used to be set but never used. It now raises the odds of rare fish, makes digging hits more likely to turn up shells, and adds one to friendship gains until morning.\n- **Knocking:** walking into a sleeping neighbour's door now gets a sleepy complaint (\"Who knocks at this hour?... Come back in the morning\") instead of letting you in. A play check covers it.\n- **Picture settings:** the Settings screen's quality and pixel-size options now drive the engine's own quality and chunky-pixel settings, which they didn't before.\n\n`AUDIT.md` records these in a new section. The play suite is now 111 checks, 0 failures; I'll know the full total when the run finishes.\n\nI haven't looked at the picture settings or tried the luck effects in play. Visit on two real computers is still untested: there is no second machine here."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":476,"cache_read_input_tokens":843154,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":476},"output_tokens":399,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"c00ac39d-aacb-4c8e-9bf9-7c12bcb12637","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:33:31.301Z","request_id":"req_011Cgkthf14HV1H2kk3JZiJP"}
