{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgktvPayc3vspFtoqwaih","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The full suite is running on the latest build, and I'll report when it finishes.\n\nI went through the plan sentence by sentence for the details I had not built and added these:\n\n- **Store hours:** Mrs. Gander's store is now shut outside 8:00 to 22:00. Walking in at 23:00 gets a \"Closed, dear\" instead of entry.\n- **Museum plaques:** completing a wing gives you a plaque with your name misspelled, as the plan describes.\n- **Trampling and squash:** running over a flower now wilts it, and your avatar squashes briefly when you stop from a run.\n- **Salon:** your avatar spins on a turntable while you pick a new look.\n- **Old Rind and Vesper:** Old Rind now stands at his stall on Market mornings, and Vesper hangs upside down from the plaza lamp on Show nights. In a screenshot Vesper hangs on the lamp, though the scene is very dark.\n\nThe play suite is now 117 checks, 0 failures. I'll know the full total when the run finishes.\n\nI haven't seen the plaque, the turntable, the trampling or Rind in play. Visit on two real computers is still untested because there is no second machine here. The tail motion, ambience, cloud shadows, gold Bell and festival crowd are still only checked by script."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":474,"cache_read_input_tokens":852647,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":474},"output_tokens":425,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"7f80ae4b-6f13-4a00-b5e4-2cdc27fe7fbc","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:36:23.678Z","request_id":"req_011CgktvPD9th1QtTDpYeRQJ"}
