{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkuxUhV2MjZStFkGhJ1s","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The full suite is running on the latest build, and I'll report when it finishes.\n\nI've now read the plan sentence by sentence through all of sections 3 to 24, and I fixed the three items I'd left open:\n\n- **Fish rings:** a ring spreads across the water where the bobber lands and where a fish bites, then fades.\n- **Target tile highlight:** a dotted outline now marks the tile in front of you (white with keyboard, sand with a pad).\n- **Mayor's arrival:** on the spring Festival Day Mayor Trundle slides across the plaza to the ribbon before the Seed Toss starts.\n\nFrom section 21 and 22 I also added a `ui.model()` call to the test handle, which reports the open screen, focus and prompts. I added a determinism test too: two separate runs with the same inputs reach the same fingerprint. A grep for TODO, placeholder and similar words in the game code finds nothing.\n\nThe play suite is now 130 checks, 0 failures; I'll know the full total when the run finishes. I haven't looked at the rings or the highlight on screen. `AUDIT.md` now lists nothing unmatched from the plan's sentences that I could identify, apart from the hardware limit and the art being code-built, with only some assets defined in the engine's model format.\n\nVisit on two real computers is still untested because there is no second machine here."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":443,"cache_read_input_tokens":903140,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":443},"output_tokens":439,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"e