{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkv5sb5jHAWRekve4Xut","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The full suite passes on the current build: 479 checks, 0 failures. That covers the build, simulation checks, the scripted playthrough, the browser suite, the AI Hub harness, both Visit tests and the sheets check. I regenerated `exit-interview.json` before the run.\n\nThe built HTML, the dev folder with `AUDIT.md`, `exit-interview.json` and `PROGRESS.md` are all in the work folder.\n\nI have now read PLAN.md sentence by sentence through sections 3 to 24, and `AUDIT.md` records what I matched. Sections 1 and 2 (the overview and the engine recipes) were covered only at section level.\n\nStill open:\n- **Visit on two real computers:** there is no second machine here. I tested the code exchange between browser sessions and processes on this computer only. This cannot be done on this computer.\n- **Art:** only some assets are in the engine's model format; the characters, trees, buildings and a few props are, but the tools, fish, bugs, fossils and paintings are built in code.\n- **Not seen or heard by me:** the fish rings, the tile highlight, the birds, the musician, footprints, moving boxes, tail motion, ambience, cloud shadows, the gold Bell and the festival crowd. Script checks cover most of them."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":937,"cache_read_input_tokens":903583,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":937},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"4425a262-40f7-4565-a98c-90f691b6f236","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:51:37.193Z","request_id":"req_011Cgkv5sBmnELxTivZWRgd8