{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkvG1GU3LQNTJdGQLWMs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The full suite is running on the latest build, and I'll report when it finishes.\n\nI converted most of the remaining art to the engine's model format:\n\n- **Fish and boot:** one parametric fish (size and flatness as parameters, colour per species) and a boot.\n- **Bugs:** nine bug shapes (butterfly, dragonfly, bee, beetle, snail, ladybird, caterpillar, hopper, firefly) plus a plain one, each recoloured per species. The firefly's tail glows.\n- **Tools and skeletons:** the net, rod, shovel, axe, watering can and slingshot, plus the two fossil skeletons that show each part as it's donated.\n\nThe kit's sheets check now passes on 30 model definitions with 0 problems; a few warnings remain, mostly about thin rods and the skeleton parts floating. I fixed the one real problem it found (the shovel blade dipped below the floor).\n\nI also spotted a plan sentence I'd missed in section 2: rounds inside the AI Hub should render at \"medium\" quality, so the game now uses that when opened in a session.\n\nIn a museum screenshot the new bug and fish displays render, but I couldn't check the net, the tools in hand or the held-up fish at close range. The play suite is now 129 checks, 0 failures; I'll know the full total when the run finishes. Single fossils, lanterns, the balloon and the snowman are still code-built primitives. Visit on two real computers is still untested because there is no second machine here."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":444,"cache_read_input_tokens":919408,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":444},"output_tokens":486,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"a0e36224-e928-4e42-b1f2-e76cdf2cdb0e","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:53:55.806Z","request_id":"req_011CgkvFzueRWerwxfczwEzB"}
