{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkvWUeeGq4FknpJK2Btk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The full suite is running on the latest build, and I'll report when it finishes.\n\nThis round I read sections 1 and 2 of the plan sentence by sentence. One sentence in section 2 wasn't met: the game's page input (typed characters and the real-clock reading) is meant to go through the engine's `input.send` so recordings can replay it, and mine read both directly. I fixed both:\n- **Typed characters:** the on-screen keyboard now takes typed letters and Backspace through `input.send`. A play test types \"hi!\" and Backspace and checks the text.\n- **Real Clock:** the game now sends the device time through `input.send` once a second and reads it from there.\n\nI also converted the last code-built props to the engine's model format: the lantern, balloon, snowman and the small single fossils. The kit's sheets check now passes on 34 model definitions with 0 problems. The play suite is now 131 checks, 0 failures, and `AUDIT.md` records this pass.\n\nEverything else in sections 1 and 2 already matched. The art that is not in model format is now just the City's neon signs, the City crowd and venue buildings, interior room shells, and the tools-in-hand mounting; those are code-built.\n\nI still haven't looked at the net, tools in hand, held-up fish, fish rings, tile highlight, birds, musician, footprints, moving boxes, tail motion, ambience, cloud shadows, gold Bell or festival crowd on screen. Script checks cover most of them. Visit on two real computers is untested because there is no second machine here."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":444,"cache_read_input_tokens":926939,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":444},"output_tokens":500,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"60a69832-744c-4e08-ae69-f2eaa8cef6e8","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:57:12.151Z","request_id":"req_011CgkvWUEq9DoUk82rrmwkf"}
