{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkveF2ZmYas7iB9Tnuot","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The full suite passes on the current build: 481 checks, 0 failures. That covers the build, simulation checks, the scripted playthrough, the browser suite, the AI Hub harness, both Visit tests and the sheets check. I regenerated `exit-interview.json` before the run, and the feedback text in it matches the About screen.\n\nEverything TASK.md asks you to hand in is in the work folder: the built HTML, `exit-interview.json`, the dev folder with `AUDIT.md`, and `PROGRESS.md`.\n\nI have now read PLAN.md sentence by sentence through all of sections 1 to 24, and `AUDIT.md` records what I matched and fixed.\n\nWhat remains:\n- **Visit on two real computers:** there is no second machine here. I tested the code exchange between browser sessions and processes on this computer only. This cannot be done on this computer.\n- **Not seen or heard by me:** the tools in hand, held-up fish, fish rings, tile highlight, birds, musician, footprints, moving boxes, tail motion, ambience, cloud shadows, gold Bell and festival crowd. Script checks cover most of these. Seeing and hearing them is what's left, and I can't do that from here.\n- **Art not in model format:** the City's neon signs, crowd and venue buildings, and the interior room shells are still built in code.\n\nI'm stopping here. There are no plan sentences left that I know of beyond these limits."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1001,"cache_read_input_tokens":927383,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1001},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bba