{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkvk5ymu7uTtPqY5dJ4K","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I looked at screenshots of several of the features I had only script-checked, and they work on screen. I changed no code this round. The last full suite passed on the current build: 481 checks, 0 failures.\n\n**Seen in screenshots:**\n- **Net:** the net shows in the avatar's hand.\n- **Tile outline:** a dotted outline marks the tile in front of the avatar.\n- **Moving boxes:** crates stand at Rocco's door.\n- **Bunting:** coloured flags are strung around the plaza on festival days.\n- **Festival crowd:** on Great Soup day the neighbours stand around the plaza dancing, waving and eating, with a chat bubble, autumn leaves falling and the \"Join the Great Soup\" prompt.\n- **Winter snow:** the Roll a snowball prompt shows.\n\n**Not seen:**\n- **Fish rings:** they were off-screen in my shot.\n- **Footprints:** too faint to judge in the snow shot.\n- **Street musician:** hidden behind the fortune tent in my City shot.\n- **Not tried at all:** the birds, the tail motion and the cloud shadows. Anything that needs ears (ambience, voices) I can't check from here.\n\nThe built HTML, `exit-interview.json`, the dev folder with `AUDIT.md` and `PROGRESS.md` are in the work folder. `AUDIT.md` now has a section listing what I saw and what I didn't.\n\nStill open:\n- **Visit on two real computers:** there is no second machine here. I tested the code exchange between browser sessions and processes on this computer only.\n- **Art in code, not model format:** the City's neon signs, crowd and venue buildings, and the interior room shells.\n\nI'm stopping here: the rest needs eyes or ears on a real run, or a second computer, and I can't supply either."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":795,"cache_read_input_tokens":937995,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":795},"output_tokens":601,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"21792fa6-4ffc-470b-9ce8-0c072b082c95","timestamp":"2026-11-06T03:00:22.622Z","request_id":"req_011Cgkvk5cBspybPU6NExdEs"}
