{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkw9rKuTK5A6umWUHkRT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The full suite passes on the current build: 480 checks, 0 failures. That covers the build, simulation checks, the scripted playthrough, the browser suite, the AI Hub harness, both Visit tests and the sheets check. I regenerated `exit-interview.json` before the run.\n\nEverything TASK.md asks you to hand in is in the work folder:\n- the built HTML\n- `exit-interview.json`\n- the dev folder with `AUDIT.md`\n- `PROGRESS.md`\n\nStill open:\n- **Visit on two real computers:** there is no second machine here. I tested the code exchange between browser sessions and processes on this computer only. This cannot be done on this computer.\n- **Not seen or heard by me:** the fish rings, footprints, birds, tail motion and cloud shadows on screen, and ambience and voices by ear. Script checks cover them. A look and a listen on a real run is what's left, and I can't supply that here.\n- **Art not in model format:** the neon signs, which are built from the bitmap font on purpose, and the venues' small props.\n\nI have read the plan sentence by sentence through all of sections 1 to 24, and `AUDIT.md` records what I matched and fixed. I'm stopping here: nothing else that I can identify is left on this machine."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":931,"cache_read_input_tokens":949302,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":931},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"718d10fe-6e6f-4900-9b2f-e7e6af55beb4","timestamp":"2026-11-06T03:05:40.606Z","request_id":"req_011Cgkw9qtcsqcC949qeHTHw"}
