e water (faint), winter footprints (light-blue prints on snow), a cloud shadow over grass, the clothesline, bird specks overhead. By ear (Web Audio analyser in Chromium): ambience is louder at the river than far from water (tests/browser.mjs audio).\nNot checked: tail motion in movement, the City musician in view, voices by ear beyond the analyser level checks.\nE\necho \"- Audit round 19: screenshots of rings, footprints, cloud shadows, birds; analyser test for ambience.\" >> ../PROGRESS.md; node tools/exit-interview.mjs; (node tests/run.mjs > shots/final24.txt 2>&1; echo done >> shots/final24.txt) & echo bg"}}}
