{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkwGLLZB7dSyWYGw5tyJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The full suite is running on the latest build, and I'll report when it finishes.\n\nI checked more of the things I'd only script-tested:\n\n- **Fish rings:** I saw faint expanding rings on the water in a screenshot.\n- **Footprints:** I saw light-blue footprints on winter snow.\n- **Cloud shadows:** I saw a soft darker shadow over the grass on a sunny day.\n- **Clothesline:** it is visible by the player's plot.\n- **Birds:** I saw small dark specks over the village. They are too small to judge their flight.\n- **Ambience:** I added a browser test that reads the audio level through Web Audio. Standing at the river, the ambience is clearly louder than far from the water. It passes (4 checks in that suite), which counts as hearing it by the method TASK.md allows.\n\nI still haven't seen the tail motion in movement, or the City musician in view (my last City shot had the fortune tent hiding him). `AUDIT.md` records what I checked this round and what I didn't.\n\nStill not in the engine's model format: the neon signs (built from the bitmap font by design) and the venues' small props. Visit on two real computers is untested because there is no second machine here."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":444,"cache_read_input_tokens":958404,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":444},"output_tokens":389,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"85101c30-c81b-4760-8150-829d56b5cf33","timestamp":"2026-11-06T03:07:06.599Z","request_id":"req_011CgkwGKwzGiGZRvfaBTvJU"}
