{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkwTnSziqmNuggsv4D5h","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The full suite is running on the latest build, and I'll report when it finishes.\n\nThis round I moved the City's street musician out from behind the fortune tent, into the open on the boulevard, and looked at him in a screenshot. He is a lemur in a red hat standing beside a crate, and his ringed tail is swung out at an angle, so the tail joint does move on screen. The crowd is visible in the same shot.\n\nThat leaves little unseen from the effects list. A screenshot is a single frame, so I haven't watched how any of these move over time, and I haven't listened to voices beyond level checks. `AUDIT.md` records this.\n\nStill not in the engine's model format: the neon signs (built from the bitmap font by design) and the venues' small props. Visit on two real computers is untested because there is no second machine here."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":445,"cache_read_input_tokens":964805,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":445},"output_tokens":257,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"a746d281-dc1a-444d-b3b7-c3a338c6c8a6","timestamp":"2026-11-06T03:09:40.746Z","request_id":"req_011CgkwTn5RZ2FyJ12t2Jy95"}
