oloured for the home by wallpaper, floor and tier) and City shopfronts are ModelDefs now (36 sheeted, 0 problems; seen in screenshots). Not ModelDefs: the neon signs (built from the bitmap font by design), the City crowd and venue hosts (critter generator, which is a ModelDef builder), and the venues' small props.\n\n## Checked by eye and by ear in the last round\nScreenshots: fish ring on the water (faint), winter footprints (light-blue prints on snow), a cloud shadow over grass, the clothesline, bird specks overhead. By ear (Web Audio analyser in Chromium): ambience is louder at the river than far from water (tests/browser.mjs audio).\nNot checked: tail motion in movement, the City musician in view, voices by ear beyond the analyser level checks.\n\nSeen in a City screenshot: the street musician (moved out from behind the fortune tent) with his ringed tail swung out, and the crowd. Remaining unseen: nothing from the effects list except motion over time (a screenshot is one frame).","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01EYoZ8fPReMaGTZ4kVPEdKB","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
