{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkxQP95ACBqySJuivGip","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The PLAN.md doesn't require every prop to be a ModelDef. It requires that every model I do define passes the sheets check, and that check passes. The remaining plain-box props (neon letters, street boxes, crates) are therefore not gaps against the plan.\n\n**State of the hand-in:**\n- **Plan items:** everything in PLAN.md that this computer can do is built. The sheets check passes (50 models drawn, 0 problems) and the full suite passes (482 checks, 0 failures).\n- **Hand-ins:** the single HTML, the dev folder, `exit-interview.json` (parses) and `PROGRESS.md` are all in the work root.\n\n**What can't be done here:**\n- **Visit across two real computers:** there's no second machine. I tested it between two pages and processes on this one.\n- **Voices by ear and motion over time:** I measured voice levels through an audio analyser and checked frames in screenshots. That isn't the same as listening or watching.\n\nI'm stopping here, because further model conversions don't change what PLAN.md asks for."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1290,"cache_read_input_tokens":50532,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1290},"output_tokens":345,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7fc0c99-6050-4a36-bbad-13de512b63e9","uuid":"9e29cba0-826f-4474-95ff-13d02eff21ca","timestamp":"2026-11-06T03:22:01.469Z","request_id":"req_011CgkxQNsCM1xPy3HEXS9Jw"}
